'''Callbacks''' are how modders hook in to Afterbirth+ and run code. There are many different callbacks, which are fired at different times, depending on what you want to do. For information about callbacks, see [https://wofsauge.github.io/IsaacDocs/rep/enums/ModCallbacks.html Wofsauge's documentation].

